From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: q6afe-dai: stop the HDMI/DP port in hw_free

hdmi-codec turns the DP audio engine off in its shutdown, which runs
before the q6afe-dai shutdown that stops the AFE port. On SM8250
DISPLAY_PORT_RX the start after such a stop often gets no answer from
the DSP within 3 s (AFE enable for port 0x6020 failed -110). Stop the
port in hw_free, which runs for every DAI before any shutdown, while the
DP engine is still on.

---
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe-dai.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe-dai.c
@@ -384,6 +384,14 @@
 
 }
 
+static int q6hdmi_hw_free(struct snd_pcm_substream *substream,
+			  struct snd_soc_dai *dai)
+{
+	q6afe_dai_shutdown(substream, dai);
+
+	return 0;
+}
+
 static int q6afe_dai_prepare(struct snd_pcm_substream *substream,
 		struct snd_soc_dai *dai)
 {
@@ -714,6 +722,7 @@
 	.remove			= msm_dai_q6_dai_remove,
 	.prepare		= q6afe_dai_prepare,
 	.hw_params		= q6hdmi_hw_params,
+	.hw_free		= q6hdmi_hw_free,
 	.shutdown		= q6afe_dai_shutdown,
 };
 
